{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9a4f17942503651493080ddd13c2760e9094a13e2b87899a3e6f0cdbbc31ac1a", "ja": "（……おっと。仕事に集中していたらいつの間にか\nこんな時間か。小休止にするかな……ふぅ）", "zh": "（……哎呀，专心工作的时候没注意，已经这么晚了啊。稍微休息一下吧……呼。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "76d1cffcdca91f2c682caa9bf76fca7716052d99615c22e36ae85487033bbca8", "ja": "{$P$}さん、遅くまで\nお仕事お疲れさまなのです。……じーっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，工作到这么晚，\n辛苦你了呢。……盯——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e73c7bff5b59884e19b3c96832501d810ed1733d068f92fc006a022214635ed5", "ja": "ああ。お疲れさま、まつり。\n？　どうしたんだ、そんなにじっと見て……。", "zh": "啊。辛苦了，茉莉。\n嗯？怎么了，一直盯着我看……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1003_021mat", "source_sha256": "2b0719648bc08cf608e88c9ab14ee0ff7a8d4dcfebecb57cf7db6c6fcbff3269", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうやら本当に\nお疲れのようなのです。姫には隠せないのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，看来你真的\n很疲惫呢。可瞒不过公主哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1004_p", "source_sha256": "93d987a655901d1de14b659c7b1fe079e6a91b95abb2af83125ad8c96a461eec", "ja": "確かに今日は忙しかったかな……？\nでも、たいしたことは……。", "zh": "今天确实挺忙的……？\n不过，也没什么大不了的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "72c0d109d7664721640d3cae984f00bedbd817914c7d58f237fa760b5ccd7213", "ja": "お疲れの{$P$}さんには、\n姫が魔法をかけてあげるのです。", "zh": "对于辛苦了的{$P$}先生，公主会为您施展魔法的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "6ebced653b2182589b8d24237b738ee575b68643414e06073c004bdbf7039b15", "ja": "元気回復には、甘～い魔法のかかったチョコを\n食べるといいのです。はい、どうぞ。", "zh": "想要恢复精神，就该吃下施加了甜～甜魔法的巧克力。来，请用。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1007_p", "source_sha256": "4ac045e9b87e0c759e7a743830596a941b692ad94214d9ea5b993e86ea42b2d8", "ja": "おお……ありがとう。\nチョコか、確かに疲労回復にはピッタリだな。", "zh": "哦哦……谢谢。\n巧克力啊，确实很适合消除疲劳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1008_021mat", "source_sha256": "e52320db2f33abf093f2e39bec98245349def0c3ac40e519b32b318d25879b9c", "ja": "昨日の公演で、お菓子の家から\nこっそり持ってきておいたのです。", "zh": "这是昨天演出时，从糖果屋里偷偷带出来的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1009_p", "source_sha256": "2b31fbde79a46c13ae6c1f771ee4fc9ffac4b21b0001206f5722f62d3f415512", "ja": "昨日の公演、お菓子の家……ああ、\nバレンタイン公演でお客さんに配ってたもんな。", "zh": "昨天的公演，糖果屋……啊，\n是情人节公演上分给观众的那个吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1010_021mat", "source_sha256": "a97a5d2740b347aca1c6c741f06ba9088c40ff421f79aa84d387e52c4a71f76c", "ja": "そうなのです。公演ではお客さんに、姫の魔法の\nかかったチョコを配れて楽しかったのです。", "zh": "就是这样。演出时能把施加了公主魔法的巧克力分给客人，真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1011_021mat", "source_sha256": "cbc3b79a93bc5564b4d281f74ea6f6fe96f009feec4c643edfae529725c93d1e", "ja": "みんな笑顔ではっぴー！　喜んでもらえて姫も\nはっぴー！な公演だったのです♪", "zh": "大家满面笑容超开心的！大家这么高兴，\n公主也超级开心！就是这样一场公演呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2dcdb40c943df6ccd0059abf0956feda6aaa77c8040236c73688d8725aaf0e4b", "ja": "まつりの魔法でみんなはっぴー！な公演だったな。\n満足のいく公演ができて、よかったよ。", "zh": "这是场用小祭的魔法让大家都幸福满满的演出啊。\n能完成一场令人满意的演出，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1013_p", "source_sha256": "e5bd6b2679a1b95fe9659a75a771be3199f1e58fa87e33ea8173caabc9946ffe", "ja": "さて、まつりのチョコで糖分補給もできたし……\nラストスパートといくかな。", "zh": "好了，也用茉莉的巧克力补充糖分了……\n\n接下来该做最后冲刺了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1014_021mat", "source_sha256": "bc77fe9750da54356eb2dd963ee4eb11e4569fff55a33cc1ec6329681c562f5d", "ja": "えっ？　お仕事、まだ残ってるのです？\n昨日公演が終わったばっかりなのに……？", "zh": "咦？工作还没做完吗？\n明明昨天才刚结束公演……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1015_p", "source_sha256": "fa679db3c252e2df5233f9a9364d7c5755a69ecb895c2d7fb713609c50b617d3", "ja": "公演後でもやる事は山ほどあるもんだよ。\n魔法の裏側は、プロデューサーの仕事だからな。", "zh": "即使公演结束后，也还有一大堆事情要做呢。  \n魔法背后的工作，就是制作人的职责啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "4b88e169f743320009a8cfc6e1c6bb1ee49237893187b83d06b27bd4cf38d3ce", "ja": "……。\nもう、そういうのずるい……。", "zh": "……。\n真是的，这样太狡猾了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1017_021mat", "source_sha256": "5dedb67145dd7d1062db99819a3b2e3d38ecb9998f8623adc3bfa6b3ce389a63", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\n仮眠が必要なら、姫に言うのですよ？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n要是需要小睡一下，要跟公主说哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4b168794588853e339e3f1ce2b6b165d6486d5684dd50a5fc5c732fa0ede5d19", "ja": "仮眠？　まあ、そこまではかからないかな。\nたぶん大丈夫……だと思うけど。", "zh": "小睡？嗯，应该还不至于需要吧。\n大概没问题……吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0313_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0313_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "3f697946a89c25b8d451b7bb5be4b9e620c0243a8dfec319cea4ea54bfbd8d47", "ja": "もし仮眠する時は、姫がとびきりの枕を用意して\nあげるのです。魔法の枕なのです。……ね？", "zh": "如果要小睡一会儿，公主会为你准备最棒的枕头哦。是魔法枕头。……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
